thub.com/playframework/playframework/pull/2843.patch","merged_at":"2014-05-19T04:47:46Z"},"body":"It would be nice to allow type projection (`object A { type Id = Int }; A#Id`) in routes. I don't know if anyone else would be interested in this but I have a cool use case in a project with Play + Slick where all the ids are typed in a way that ensures they can't be mixed up.\n\nI've tried without success the alternative of using a case class with type parameter (`case class Id[T](value: Int)`) to add type safety to the router/reverse router, but the compiler didn't like to have a part of the url of type Id[T]. Is there a way around this?\n","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/playframework/playframework/issues/2843/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/playframework/playframework/issues/2843/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":null}},"event":"cross-referenced"},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/playframework/playframework/issues/comments/44587434","html_url":"https://github.com/playframework/playframework/issues/2402#issuecomment-44587434","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/playframework/playframework/issues/2402","id":44587434,"node_id":"MDEyOklzc3VlQ29tbWVudDQ0NTg3NDM0","user":{"login":"howyp","id":4593903,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ1OTM5MDM=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/4593903?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/howyp","html_url":"https://github.com/howyp","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/howyp/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/howyp/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/howyp/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/howyp/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/howyp/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/howyp/orgs","repos_u